<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson wins five-year New Zealand order.</title>
<headline>Ericsson wins five-year New Zealand order.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group Ericsson said on Wednesday it signed a five-year mobile telephone network contract with Telecom New Zealand worth between 1.58 billion ($202.5 million) and 2.76 billion crowns.</p>
<p>($ = 7.802 Swedish Crowns)</p>
</text>
